@shipmentId = 01a17994-dc64-770c-9dbf-bac239cff2f1

### 1. Find a late shipment that's still in transit (merchant-1)
# @name late
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/shipments?late=true&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}

### 2. Open a Late claim: 201
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-001

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Late", "note": "Promised date passed." }

### 3. Exactly the same again (a retry): 200, the SAME claim id as in 2
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-001

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Late", "note": "Promised date passed." }

### 4. The same key, a different note: 422
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-001

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Late", "note": "Something else." }

### 5. A new key, the same shipment and reason: 409 with claimId
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-002

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Late" }

### 6. Damaged on a shipment that isn't delivered: 409 (the domain rule)
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-005

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Lost" }

### 7. No Idempotency-Key: 400
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Lost" }

### 8. A read-only token tries to write: 403
POST {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-claim-004

{ "shipmentId": "{{shipmentId}}", "reason": "Lost" }

### 9. merchant-1's claims: exactly ONE
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}

### 10. merchant-2's claims: [] (isolation)
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant2}}

### 11. Who am I? merchant-1, read scope only
GET {{publicapi}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{readonly1}}
